abstract: >
  ZenBrain is a 7-layer memory architecture integrating fifteen
  neuroscience-inspired algorithms into a unified system for autonomous
  AI agents. On LongMemEval-Full-500 it reaches 91.3% of long-context-
  oracle accuracy at 1/106th the per-query token budget, and wins 12/12
  head-to-head judge comparisons against Letta, Mem0, and A-Mem
  (Bonferroni-corrected p ≤ 6.2×10⁻³¹).
